   "message": "SEB-301 backlog 5a: Australia to India route (#662)\n\n* SEB-301 backlog 5a: Australia to India route (Independent Reserve, then WazirX)\n\ncollector.py CORRIDORS gets one AUD->INR entry: on-ramp, network fee and AUD deposit copied unchanged from AUD->PHP,\noff-ramp, TDS and INR withdrawal copied unchanged from SGD->INR, the same ladder. collector_providers.py CORRIDOR_CCY,\none collect.yml step, the providers file (header only) in the commit list, and the route's name in copy.json.\nAdditive only. The Aider builder failed this job twice on tests/check_home_emitters.py, which passes here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QRa6Fsdt1zkuqGXAeFMk1D\n\n* SEB-301 backlog 5a: regenerate the route files for AUD->INR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QRa6Fsdt1zkuqGXAeFMk1D\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
