   "message": "SEB-301 backlog 2a: United States to Brazil route (Coinbase, then Foxbit) (#663)\n\ncollector.py: one USD->BRL entry in CORRIDORS (Coinbase side copied unchanged from USD->MXN) and an off-ramp reader for\nFoxbit's public order book (fetch_offramp_foxbit, dispatched like Bitso, Luno and WazirX). Foxbit fees from its own table,\nfoxbit.com.br/taxas, read 24 Oct: taker 0.50%, maker 0.25% at the lowest tier, BRL withdrawal to a bank free.\ncollector_providers.py CORRIDOR_CCY, one collect.yml step, the providers file (header only) in the commit list, the\nroute's name in copy.json, and the two route files regenerated so the route self-test sees no stale file.\nNot additive (a new reader function in collector.py), so it needs the collector-gate run and a merge by hand.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QRa6Fsdt1zkuqGXAeFMk1D\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
