   "message": "SEB-301: site pass 24 Oct, counts that add up, findings numbering, dead pages redirected, tab titles (#656)\n\n* SEB-301: site pass, 24 Oct: counts that add up, findings numbering, dead pages redirected, plain tab titles\n\n- Countries: the no-price list held 11 while the line above said 5. Countries with no price in 30 days are not\n  tracked (home's rule), so they move to the 'we also check' line and the list shows the 5 tracked ones.\n- Home findings list: no numbers. It is in Seb's order, so the Findings page numbers read 03, 04, 01, 02.\n- A finding page's chips and 'We also found these' skip the unpublished finding, so they number 01 to 04 like the\n  Findings page (they showed 05 chips and an unpublished finding).\n- tape.html, corridor.html and fee-tiers.html were stale (44 countries, old fee figures, 'corridor') and now redirect\n  to Countries, Routes and the fee tier finding. The 'Watch live prices' link on How it was built is gone.\n- Browser tab titles: 'margin.wiki: Page', no dashes, the same nav words on every page.\nNo words on the pages changed. No data or method changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QRa6Fsdt1zkuqGXAeFMk1D\n\n* SEB-301: inventory baseline and hand-run page check follow the three redirects and the new tab titles\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QRa6Fsdt1zkuqGXAeFMk1D\n\n* SEB-301: the rendered gates skip pages that only redirect (tape, corridor, fee-tiers), which rendered Countries under tape's name\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QRa6Fsdt1zkuqGXAeFMk1D\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
